<title>AUSTRALIA: Stadium Australia packages make ASX debut.</title>
<headline>Stadium Australia packages make ASX debut.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold packages in the Stadium Australia Group made their debut on the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) at A$2,210 per package.</p>
<p>Each gold package comprises 1,000 units in the Stadium Australia Trust stapled to 1,000 shares in Stadium Australia Management Ltd and one gold membership entitlement.</p>
<p>The packages do not include an Olympic ticket component.</p>
<p>By 11.20 a.m. (0120 GMT), 10 gold packages had been traded with a low of A$2200 and a high of A$2210.</p>
<p>Platinum packages were untraded.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373-1810</p>
</text>
